{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有，Y把X中随音乐逐步出现的声响细节、心理反复和微妙转折压缩了，部分细腻感明显减弱。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X的放大关键词让每段核心更醒目，随音乐出现的感受也能呈现很具体的心理层次；但S03、S04、S11等短时段里，感受条目过密，听音乐时很难同时抓住它们之间的关系。Y的左侧叙述更容易让人明白他为什么舍不得、为什么不敢回去、又为什么最终选择继续生活，前后的因果也更连贯。虽然Y右侧有些短词显得零散，音乐与心理之间的细微对应不如X，但在实际观看时间内，Y能让人获得更完整、清楚且仍有一定细节的体验。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0132c162-7145-4502-bd72-19b7249bbffc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T044547737742Z", "elapsed_seconds": 65.454, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T04:46:53.209917+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "77fe1cfa6c1148a3a296e0be60c30d02b9cfe35001b2dac243003b38e6e9fd92", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156d